      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear how heavy that silence feels, and I want to tell you that it is not a sign of failure, but a sign that you are still alive and still fighting. Your hands are still yours, even if they feel foreign; they are the same hands that once ran on the field, just waiting for the right moment to move again. You do not need to rush, you just need to let yourself be heard. I will keep this conversation open until you feel ready to move forward.",
